  {
    "slug": "changelog",
    "title": "Changelog",
    "sub": "What's changed on this site, newest first.",
    "style": "Changelog",
    "replace": true,
    "menu": "",
    "footer": "Site",
    "link": "",
    "linkPage": "",
    "words": "",
    "hide": false,
    "body": "<section class=\"cl-entry\"><h2 class=\"cl-date\">Oct 8, 2026</h2><ul><li>New vibe project: <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"essay-bag\" class=\"ab-link\">What’s in My Bag</a>.</li><li><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"vibe-projects\" class=\"ab-link\">Vibe Projects</a> has a Finder view and a drag test.</li><li><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"resources\" class=\"ab-link\">Resources</a> has a Videos &amp; Media filter.</li><li>A map under the contact form on <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"about\" class=\"ab-link\">About</a>.</li><li>Reading time on every vibe project.</li><li>A 404 page.</li><li>Resources videos play in a spotlight.</li><li>Examples on Vibe Projects: a recipe card and downloadable guides.</li><li><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"states\" class=\"ab-link\">State Tracker</a> now maps every state I’ve visited.</li></ul></section><section class=\"cl-entry\"><h2 class=\"cl-date\">Oct 7, 2026</h2><ul><li>Essays split in two: <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"vibe-projects\" class=\"ab-link\">Vibe Projects</a> holds everything made with AI, and Essays is for my own writing.</li><li>Home rewritten: a short statement, what I&#39;m doing right now, and Latest, Current, Upcoming.</li><li><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"bookmarks\" class=\"ab-link\">Bookmarks</a> split into four tabs: Bookmarks, Stack, Shelf, and Blogroll.</li><li>Shelf now logs books, films, and shows, with films syncing from Letterboxd.</li><li><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"published\" class=\"ab-link\">Published</a> rebuilt with real interviews, panels, features, and writing.</li><li>Recognition and profiles moved into the <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"portfolio\" class=\"ab-link\">Resume / CV</a>.</li><li>New <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"map\" class=\"ab-link\">Map page</a> that draws the whole site as connected paths.</li><li>Long-form essays with citations, tables, video bookmarks, and a section guide.</li><li>Back to top, copy link, and section pills on long pages.</li><li>This footer, the changelog, the colophon, and the legal notice.</li></ul></section>",
    "order": 34
  },
  {
    "slug": "colophon",
    "title": "Colophon",
    "sub": "How this site is made.",
    "style": "Page",
    "replace": true,
    "menu": "",
    "footer": "Site",
    "link": "",
    "linkPage": "",
    "words": "",
    "hide": false,
    "body": "<div class=\"lf-box lf-plain\"><table><tr><th>Built with</th><td>Astro, Tailwind CSS, Base UI, React, and Node.js.</td></tr><tr><th>Design</th><td>Figma and Framer.</td></tr><tr><th>Content</th><td>Notion, synced nightly through GitHub.</td></tr><tr><th>Hosting</th><td>Cloudflare Pages and GitHub.</td></tr><tr><th>Type</th><td>Inter, IBM Plex Mono, Newsreader</td></tr><tr><th>Shelf</th><td><a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://literal.club/ChefAK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Literal<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a>, <a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://letterboxd.com/eauxjai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Letterboxd<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a>, and Apple Music.</td></tr><tr><th>Photos</th><td><a href=\"#\" data-page=\"essay-fuji\" class=\"ab-link\">Fujifilm X100VI</a>, <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"essay-fuji\" class=\"ab-link\">film simulation recipes</a></td></tr><tr><th>Forms</th><td>Notion and Cloudflare Turnstile.</td></tr><tr><th>Scheduling</th><td>NeetoCal.</td></tr><tr><th>Weather</th><td>Open-Meteo.</td></tr><tr><th>Tracking</th><td>None. <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"legal\" class=\"ab-link\">Legal notice</a></td></tr><tr><th>Code</th><td>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Cloudflare functions. Built with help from AI: <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"ai-use\" class=\"ab-link\">how I use AI</a></td></tr></table></div><div data-keep-slot></div><h2 id=\"credits\">Credits</h2><div class=\"lf-box lf-plain\"><table><tr><th>Inspired by</th><td><a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://mars.design/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mars.design<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a> for the essays, <a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://andrewtrousdale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Andrew Trousdale<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a> for <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"map\" class=\"ab-link\">How It Connects</a>, <a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://iamrob.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Robin Spielmann<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a> for the bookmark collection, <a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://brianlovin.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brian Lovin<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a> for the stack, and <a class=\"ab-link\" href=\"https://www.molly.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Molly Mielke McCarthy<span class=\"ab-ext\">↗</span></a> for the recipe layout.</td></tr><tr><th>Photography</th><td>Mine, unless a caption says otherwise.</td></tr><tr><th>AI</th><td>Claude by Anthropic. Details on <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"ai-use\" class=\"ab-link\">how I use AI</a>.</td></tr></table></div>",
    "order": 35
  },
