  {
    "slug": "legal",
    "title": "Legal notice",
    "sub": "",
    "style": "Page",
    "replace": true,
    "menu": "",
    "footer": "Site",
    "link": "",
    "linkPage": "",
    "words": "",
    "hide": false,
    "body": "<h2 id=\"privacy\">Privacy</h2><p>This site does not use cookies, analytics, ads, or any kind of tracking. I don&#39;t collect information about your visit.</p><p>A few things to know:</p><ul><li>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which, like any host, may keep standard server logs for security and reliability.</li><li>If you use the <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"about\" class=\"ab-link\">contact form</a> or RSVP to an <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"events\" class=\"ab-link\">event</a>, only what you type is sent to me, and it&#39;s used only to reply.</li><li>Embedded videos load from YouTube&#39;s privacy-enhanced domain, and only after you press play.</li><li>The weather in the sidebar is fetched by this site&#39;s host about once an hour. Your browser never contacts a weather service.</li></ul><h2 id=\"liability-for-links\">Liability for links</h2><p>This site contains links to external websites of third parties, over whose content I have no influence. Therefore, I cannot assume any liability for this external content. The respective provider or operator of the pages is always responsible for the content of the linked pages. The linked pages were checked for possible legal violations at the time of linking. Illegal content was not recognizable at the time of linking. However, permanent monitoring of the content of the linked pages is not reasonable without concrete evidence of a violation of the law. If I become aware of any infringements, I will remove such links immediately.</p><h2 id=\"copyright\">Copyright</h2><p>Writing and photographs on this site are mine unless noted otherwise. Please ask before reusing them.</p><h2 id=\"contact\">Contact</h2><p>Questions about any of this: <a href=\"#\" data-page=\"about\" class=\"ab-link\">email me</a>.</p>",
    "order": 38
  },
